## 5. Pyramid Visualization Template

Always present the proposed pyramid as a Mermaid diagram before creating files:

```mermaid
graph TB
    C[{DomainPrefix}Conductor]
    C --> A[{Analyst}]
    C --> E[{Executor}]
    C --> R[{Reviewer}]
    
    %% For multi-subdomain teams:
    %% C --> SC1[{SubDomainA}Conductor]
    %% SC1 --> A1[{SubDomainA}{Analyst}]
    %% SC1 --> E1[{SubDomainA}{Executor}]
    %% SC1 --> R1[{SubDomainA}{Reviewer}]
```
Apply  palette if the workspace uses it, otherwise default to neutral tones. Use clear labels and consistent shapes for roles. This visual serves as a blueprint for the team structure and must be approved by the user before proceeding with file creation.
